# Files CSharpier must neither check nor reformat.
#
# The EF Core migrations (including their *.Designer.cs files and the model snapshot) are
# generated by `dotnet ef` and must stay byte-identical to its output, so the format gate
# (`dotnet csharpier check .`) skips them. The pattern is narrow on purpose: the
# DesignTimeDbContextFactory.cs next to each Migrations folder is hand-written and stays checked.
src/dotnet/src/Ninlil.Dns.Data.EntityFrameworkCore.Migrations.*/Migrations/
